# fd44: keep the bar's update count honest after a dnf transaction.
# Needs libdnf5-plugin-actions.
#
# Format (libdnf5-actions(8)): callback_name:package_filter:direction:options:command
#
# The empty package filter runs the command once per transaction rather than
# once per package. enabled=host-only skips transactions on an --installroot:
# installing into a chroot does not change what this system has waiting, and
# install/fedora_bootstrap.sh does exactly that.
#
# post_transaction only. Nothing useful can be said before the packages change,
# and a pre hook would only make the count wrong a few seconds earlier.
post_transaction:::enabled=host-only:/usr/local/bin/fd44-updates-invalidate
